# CHIMERA v6 - evaluation report

Generated by `src/scripts/analyze_v2.py --tag v6` from `results/results_v6.csv` (3870 runs: 43 configurations x 9 workloads x 10 seeds) and `results/results_v6_sweep.csv` (4095 runs).

All controllers share the same resource bounds (0.5 core/pod start, >= 2 replicas), the same traces and the same seeds. In the headline tables each runs at its own default setting (baselines: 70 % target utilisation; CHIMERA: its configured default), so the like-for-like comparison is the equal-CPU frontier analysis further down. Scored window: minutes 70-100.

